COMMUNITY BOT — RAILWAY

FILES:
- index.js
- deploy-commands.js
- config.js
- package.json

ENV:
TOKEN=your_bot_token

VOLUME:
/app/data

START COMMAND:
npm run deploy && npm start

DISCORD DEVELOPER PORTAL -> BOT:
Enable:
- SERVER MEMBERS INTENT
- MESSAGE CONTENT INTENT

BOT PERMISSIONS:
- View Channels
- Send Messages
- Embed Links
- Attach Files
- Read Message History
- Manage Channels
- Manage Roles
- Manage Messages
- Moderate Members

ROLE ORDER:
The bot role must be ABOVE the Member role and users it may moderate.

VERIFY:
1. Fill memberRoleId.
2. Put only writable community channel IDs inside verifyWritableChannelIds.
3. Run /setup-verify INSIDE the Verify channel.

Result:
- Verify stays public/read-only.
- Public rooms become Member-only.
- IDs in verifyWritableChannelIds: Members can write.
- Other public text rooms: Members can read but cannot write.
- Existing private Staff/Admin rooms stay private.

TICKETS:
/ticket-panel

Options:
- עזרה מצוות 🆘
- רכישת משתמש 💵
- הצעת שיתוף פעולה 🤝

HELP:
!h
!h <reason>

Staff can Claim the Help request.

MODERATION — MANAGEMENT ONLY:
/timeout
/untimeout
/clear


HELP VOICE:
- !h shows the requester's current Voice channel.
- If not in Voice, it shows: לא מחובר לוויס
- Reason + Voice remain visible after Staff Claim.


XP + CASINO — ZONE X STYLE:
- Normal chat messages earn XP.
- Default: 5-15 XP per eligible message.
- XP cooldown: 60 seconds.

Commands:
- !xp
- !balance
- !bal
- !xphelp
- !casino
- !coinflip <xp> <heads/tails>
- !cf <xp> <heads/tails>
- !dice <xp> <1-6>
- !slots <xp>

Staff XP:
- !addxp @user <amount>
- !removexp @user <amount>
- !setxp @user <amount>

XP SHOP:
1. Fill xpShop role IDs / names / prices in config.js.
2. Put the bot role ABOVE every shop role.
3. Run /setup-xp-shop.

Users buy with buttons only.
XP is deducted only AFTER the role is successfully given.

XP DATA:
/app/data/xp.json

Casino and XP are virtual server points only.
No real-money purchase and no cashout.


